<h2>October 31, 2006</h2>


<h1 id="a000138">Cameron Highlands</h1>

<p><a href="http://www.flickr.com/photos/theroadislife/284414710/" title="Photo Sharing"><img src="http://static.flickr.com/112/284414710_cdf4da4d3e.jpg" width="480" height="360" alt="IMG_0377[1]" /></a><br />
PALAU PANGKOR, MALAYSIA - After several days trekking around the cool (and rainy) Cameron Highlands, <a href="http://www.einsteinno1.de/">Pete</a>, my new partner in crime, and I have migrated back to sea-level for some beach time on Palau Pangkor before we continue our pilgrimage Northward on this, the Asian leg of my adventure.   I expect to be in Thailand a week.</p>



